(Office of Example Records - Solicitation OER-26-R-0042) Tj
T*
(OFFICE OF EXAMPLE RECORDS \(FICTIONAL\)) Tj
T*
(SOLICITATION NO. OER-26-R-0042) Tj
T*
(HELP DESK AND END-USER SUPPORT SERVICES) Tj
T*
(This is a sample solicitation written to demonstrate amagi-federal-compliance-matrix.) Tj
T*
(The agency, the requirements and the dates are fictional.) Tj
T*
(TABLE OF CONTENTS) Tj
T*
(SECTION B - SUPPLIES OR SERVICES AND PRICES .......... 1) Tj
T*
(SECTION C - PERFORMANCE WORK STATEMENT .......... 2) Tj
T*
(SECTION L - INSTRUCTIONS TO OFFERORS .......... 4) Tj
