T*
(PART I - THE SCHEDULE) Tj
T*
(SECTION B - SUPPLIES OR SERVICES AND PRICES) Tj
T*
(B.1 Pricing. Offerors shall price each contract line item \(CLIN\) on a firm-fixed-price) Tj
T*
(basis. CLIN 0001 covers the base year and CLINs 1001 through 4001 cover four option) Tj
T*
(years.) Tj
T*
(Prices shall include all labor, travel, tools and overhead needed to perform Section C.) Tj
T*
(SECTION C - PERFORMANCE WORK STATEMENT) Tj
T*
(C.1 Background) Tj
T*
(The Office of Example Records supports about 1,200 employees at three sites. The) Tj
T*
(Government will furnish workspace, telephones and network access for on-site staff.) Tj
T*
("Business day" shall mean Monday through Friday, excluding Federal holidays.) Tj
T*
(C.2 Scope) Tj
T*
(The Contractor shall provide Tier 1 and Tier 2 help desk support, desk-side support and) Tj
T*
(asset management for all Office of Example Records users.) Tj
T*
(C.3 Tasks) Tj
T*
(C.3.1 Help Desk. The Contractor shall staff the help desk from 7:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m.) Tj
T*
(Eastern Time on every business day. The Contractor shall:) Tj
T*
(\(a\) answer 90 percent of calls within 60 seconds;) Tj
T*
(Page 1 of 3) Tj
T*
