(Office of Example Records - Solicitation OER-26-R-0042) Tj
T*
(\(b\) resolve 70 percent of Tier 1 tickets on first contact; and) Tj
T*
(\(c\) log every contact in the Government ticketing system.) Tj
T*
(C.3.2 Asset Management. The Contractor shall maintain: \(a\) an inventory of all end-user) Tj
T*
(devices; \(b\) a knowledge base of known fixes; and \(c\) a monthly asset report.) Tj
T*
(C.3.3 Security. Contractor personnel shall not install software that is not on the) Tj
T*
(approved list. The Contractor must report a suspected security incident to the) Tj
T*
(Contracting Officer's Representative within one hour of discovery.) Tj
T*
(C.4 Key Personnel) Tj
T*
(The Program Manager shall have at least five years of experience managing help desk) Tj
T*
(contracts of similar size. Key personnel must hold an active Secret clearance at) Tj
T*
(contract start.) Tj
T*
(C.5 Deliverables) Tj
T*
(A monthly status report is required by the fifth business day of each month. All) Tj
T*
(deliverables shall be submitted in Microsoft Word or PDF format.) Tj
T*
(PART II - CONTRACT CLAUSES) Tj
T*
(SECTION I - CONTRACT CLAUSES) Tj
T*
(The following clauses are incorporated by reference:) Tj
T*
(52.204-21 Basic Safeguarding of Covered Contractor Information Systems \(NOV 2021\)) Tj
T*
(52.217-9 Option to Extend the Term of the Contract \(MAR 2000\)) Tj
T*
(52.222-41 Service Contract Labor Standards \(AUG 2018\)) Tj
T*
(52.232-33 Payment by Electronic Funds Transfer - System for Award Management \(OCT 2018\)) Tj
T*
(PART IV - REPRESENTATIONS AND INSTRUCTIONS) Tj
T*
(SECTION L - INSTRUCTIONS TO OFFERORS) Tj
T*
(L.1 General Instructions) Tj
T*
(Offerors shall submit proposals by e-mail to the Contracting Officer no later than 2:00) Tj
T*
(p.m. Eastern Time on November 20, 2026. Late proposals will not be considered.) Tj
T*
(Questions must be submitted in writing no later than November 2, 2026. The Government) Tj
T*
(will post answers as an amendment to this solicitation.) Tj
T*
