(Office of Example Records - Solicitation OER-26-R-0042) Tj
T*
(L.2 Proposal Volumes) Tj
T*
(Each proposal shall consist of the following volumes:) Tj
T*
(\(a\) Volume I, Technical, limited to 25 pages;) Tj
T*
(\(b\) Volume II, Past Performance, limited to 10 pages; and) Tj
T*
(\(c\) Volume III, Price, with no page limit.) Tj
T*
(L.3 Format) Tj
T*
(Pages shall be 8.5 by 11 inches with one-inch margins. Text must be 12 point or larger;) Tj
T*
(tables may use 10 point. Pages beyond the limit will not be evaluated.) Tj
T*
(L.4 Technical Volume) Tj
T*
(The offeror shall describe its approach to each task in Section C. The technical volume) Tj
T*
(should include a staffing matrix. Resumes are required for the Program Manager and the) Tj
T*
(Help Desk Lead.) Tj
T*
(L.5 Past Performance Volume) Tj
T*
(Offerors shall provide no more than three \(3\) references for contracts performed within) Tj
T*
(the last five \(5\) years. Each reference must include a point of contact and the contract) Tj
T*
(value. See FAR 52.212-1 for general instructions.) Tj
T*
(SECTION M - EVALUATION FACTORS FOR AWARD) Tj
T*
(M.1 Basis for Award) Tj
T*
(The Government will award a contract to the offeror whose proposal represents the best) Tj
T*
(value. Technical and past performance, combined, are more important than price.) Tj
T*
(M.2 Evaluation Factors) Tj
T*
(Proposals will be evaluated on Factor 1, Technical Approach; Factor 2, Past Performance;) Tj
T*
(and Factor 3, Price. The offeror must receive an Acceptable rating on Factor 1 to be) Tj
T*
(eligible for award.) Tj
T*
(Page 3 of 3) Tj
T*
